===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|pt|Bombaim}}, possibly from {{der|en|mr|मुंबादेवी||goddess Mumba}}<ref>{{R:Online_Etymology_Dictionary}}</ref> or from {{compound|pt|bom|baim|nocat=1}}.<ref name="Shirodkar 1998 7">{{harvnb|Shirodkar|1998|p=7}}</ref>{{attention|en|check Marathi}} Most likely a combination of both.

