|passage=Have you heard any word<br>Of that bloke in the "Third" -<br>Was it Sotherby, Sedgewick or Sim?<br>They had him chucked out of a club in '''Bombay'''.<br>But apart from his mess bills exceeding his pay,<br>He took to pig-sticking in ''quite'' the wrong way.<br>I wonder what happened to him?}}
